  "notes": [
   "w4_arms.py@sol finished every attempt, then failed before writing its metadata (it read a base arm's budget, and this run has none); sol-meta.json was written by hand from the C5 metadata with this run's campaign, seed, model, arms, baseline, repetitions, and scenarios, seconds 0 (not measured), and budget cap 6.0 (two arms of 3.0) and spent 3.408675 (the sum of the attempts' cost)",
   "so meta.commits is the C5 campaign's except brain, set by hand to b176a74; the checkouts this run measured were umbrella a6019d07, Team 5b85be7 (both from their reflogs at the run's start), and the Brain code of c895fbf (brain_checkout)",
   "the tiebreak judge is gpt-6.1-sol, not claude-sonnet-5-5 (the Anthropic test key had no credit), so every verdict is exploratory"
  ],
